  instagram: '<path d="M12 7.3a4.7 4.7 0 1 0 0 9.4 4.7 4.7 0 0 0 0-9.4zm0 7.7a3 3 0 1 1 0-6 3 3 0 0 1 0 6zm6-7.9a1.1 1.1 0 1 1-2.2 0 1.1 1.1 0 0 1 2.2 0zM16.4 3H7.6A4.6 4.6 0 0 0 3 7.6v8.8A4.6 4.6 0 0 0 7.6 21h8.8a4.6 4.6 0 0 0 4.6-4.6V7.6A4.6 4.6 0 0 0 16.4 3zm2.9 13.4a2.9 2.9 0 0 1-2.9 2.9H7.6a2.9 2.9 0 0 1-2.9-2.9V7.6a2.9 2.9 0 0 1 2.9-2.9h8.8a2.9 2.9 0 0 1 2.9 2.9v8.8z"/>',
